cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the version you used and cite the companion manuscript separately."
type: software
title: "Atlantic bigeye tuna age inversion"
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/shuohui-air-technology/atlantic-bigeye-age-inversion"
authors:
  - given-names: Peng
    family-names: Lian
  - given-names: Haoran
    family-names: Yu
abstract: >-
  Python software for estimating coarse age-group catch indicators for Atlantic
  bigeye tuna from four commercial weight bins. It fits monthly age states
  from weight-based catch per unit effort and allocates operation catches to
  age groups in fish equivalents.
keywords:
  - Atlantic bigeye tuna
  - age inversion
  - catch per unit effort
  - fisheries
references:
  - type: unpublished
    title: "Inferring Coarse Age Structure from Commercial Weight Bins: An Exploratory Approach for Atlantic Bigeye Tuna"
